1c:["$","div",null,{"style":{"color":"var(--text-secondary)","fontSize":"0.98rem","lineHeight":1.85,"whiteSpace":"pre-line","marginBottom":"1.5rem"},"children":"Hosting over 80 visiting school principals and academic directors at the ACHARIYA Central Campus in Puducherry, Dr. J. Arawindhan Ji unpacked the operational machinery of ACHARIYA's 25-year journey.\n\nKey takeaways highlighted during the conclave:\n1. Brain Activity Over Ability: Why ranking students against a single bell curve stifles latent genius, and how physical Five Arts training directly expands working memory.\n2. The 100% Learning Curve: How standard operating procedures (SOPs) eliminate the arbitrary \"luck of the teacher\" in classroom quality.\n3. The Powered School Model: How independent schools can adopt ACHARIYA’s proprietary curricula and diagnostic TRACK assessment without losing administrative autonomy."}]
